      "id": "at-glance",
      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "Say Có màu khác không? when you need \"Do you have another color\". This is for when the item is right but the color is wrong. This is the simplest comparison phrase for clothing and small goods. Listen for a yes/no answer, a gesture toward the item, or a short alternative; use the next rows if the exchange moves on.",
