      "id": "why-it-matters",
      "title": "Why it matters",
      "body": "Shopping phrases keep the exchange short while still giving the seller enough detail to help. For \"Do you have another color\", Có màu khác không? makes the next step easier to answer. If they point somewhere else, follow the gesture first and ask again only if the next step is unclear.",
      "presentation": "plain-text"
    },
